    r"обобщ|резюм|суммариз|summary|overview|summari[sz]e|outline|"
    r"(?:key|main)\s+points?|what\s+(?:does\s+.+\s+say|is\s+.+\s+about)|"
    r"tell\s+me\s+what\s+.+\s+is\s+about)\w*\b",
